<c.simplifiedchinese>真的没必要请剑客警官来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:22.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是三等军士</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>却在给我这个
萨摩藩出身的维新志士提意见？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:25.838 --> 00:08:27.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说“解散” 就赶紧消失在我眼前</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:30.134 --> 00:08:33.095 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不把剑拔出来呢 绅士？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:36.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在东京内持剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:36.224 --> 00:08:38.935 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定对自己的剑术很自信吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:39.018 --> 00:08:42.355 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不会为了好玩而佩剑挥舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:48.152 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是为了告诉你
在下佩剑不是为了展示力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:50.696 --> 00:08:51.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:53.241 --> 00:08:55.743 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们是一伙的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:55.826 --> 00:08:56.953 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士 不要过来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:05.670 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来 我要砍断你的和服羞辱你</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:06.671 --> 00:09:08.005 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再问你一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:08.589 --> 00:09:10.424 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不拔剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:11.759 --> 00:09:12.969 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:13.678 --> 00:09:15.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的是警察吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:17.056 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>千真万确</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:17.139 --> 00:09:22.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>允许持剑合法杀人的警察</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:25.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要因为你是政府官员就动用武力</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:27.608 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-简直骇人听闻！
-太不要脸了 混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:29.151 --> 00:09:32.154 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是蠢蛋 竟对我大喊大叫</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:32.738 --> 00:09:34.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种行为符合拒绝服从官员命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:34.657 --> 00:09:36.784 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>每个人都抓起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:36.867 --> 00:09:38.744 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>允许拔剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何反抗者 杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.132 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:51.716 --> 00:09:53.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个小镇的市民</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:53.843 --> 00:09:56.053 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要对这些人拔剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:57.513 --> 00:10:00.391 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想找对手的话 在下在此恭候</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:05.104 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是好好先生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:05.896 --> 00:10:08.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀？你的剑可真奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:09.025 --> 00:10:11.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎样 现在我有权利杀你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:15.740 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:15.823 --> 00:10:20.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有时必须杀人来保持自己的敏锐度</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:24.832 --> 00:10:25.958 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:31.172 --> 00:10:33.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了 他是冒名顶替的</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:34.008 --> 00:10:34.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:35.009 --> 00:10:41.098 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来晚了
之前在处理西南战争的后事</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:41.182 --> 00:10:44.226 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果仔细想想 也很明显</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:48.064 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村可不是会犯下这种暴行的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:53.027 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>确实 他杀人无数
配称“刽子手拔刀斋”</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:57.823 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他从来不会肆意杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:58.407 --> 00:11:01.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他过去做的一切
都是为了新时代 明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:01.285 --> 00:11:06.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是用自己的剑
救了很多维新志士的命的英雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:10.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是他 明治时代都不会到来</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:13.881 --> 00:11:19.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想找到他
给他在帝国军队安排一个领导地位</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:22.264 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>关于这点…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:26.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>罪犯一大早就被绑在警视厅门口了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:26.644 --> 00:11:29.230 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我们不知道是谁干的</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:29.939 --> 00:11:33.025 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但问他们 他们说
“被真的拔刀斋识破了”</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:33.109 --> 00:11:34.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:34.235 --> 00:11:38.072 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟这是不可信的犯罪分子说的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:39.073 --> 00:11:40.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>长官 不好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:43.911 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋 这还有客人 至少敲一下门！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:43.994 --> 00:11:45.579 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:45.663 --> 00:11:47.915 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 剑客警官…</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:51.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>宇治木那家伙又在惹麻烦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:51.377 --> 00:11:53.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑客警官？</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:53.254 --> 00:11:54.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没听说过这样的番队</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:54.547 --> 00:12:00.678 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是为这次拔刀斋事件成立的番队</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:00.761 --> 00:12:05.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但都是些残暴的人
而他们的长官是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:08.477 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩出身的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:08.561 --> 00:12:10.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也很难对付他</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:11.522 --> 00:12:15.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根据地域来源
维新志士可以分为五类</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:16.068 --> 00:12:22.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩 长州藩 土佐藩
肥前藩和其他如水户藩和福冈藩等</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:22.825 --> 00:12:25.828 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中 萨摩藩和长州藩</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:25.911 --> 00:12:28.789 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为明治政府结构中的两大势力
长期占支配地位</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:31.292 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在此期间</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:31.375 --> 00:12:35.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩在警力管理具有绝对力量
长州藩则在军队管理具有绝对力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:37.173 --> 00:12:38.299 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:38.382 --> 00:12:43.179 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是萨摩藩出身的维新志士的话
就难免会傲慢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:43.762 --> 00:12:47.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有 他这次又惹了什么麻烦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:47.224 --> 00:12:49.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个 实际上…</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:53.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们其实一直在占下风
被区区一名剑客打</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:53.606 --> 00:12:55.483 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？岂有此理！</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:58.486 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是从我们部门
最优秀的剑客中遴选出来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:00.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:00.821 --> 00:13:02.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不可置信</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:02.781 --> 00:13:06.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那男人究竟是谁？
-不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:06.285 --> 00:13:11.123 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是一个红头发的矮瘦男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:11.749 --> 00:13:15.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>动作很快 几乎看不清</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:15.377 --> 00:13:19.590 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 我记得
他的左脸有一个很大的十字疤痕</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:21.717 --> 00:13:22.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:26.805 --> 00:13:28.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:29.099 --> 00:13:30.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:30.392 --> 00:13:32.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们因为人数多就手下留情了</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:32.603 --> 00:13:33.979 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你也太过分了吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:36.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招 鹡鸰一刀流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.859 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招吧！雅居狮影流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:38.943 --> 00:13:41.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备迎接我的神道纪念流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还剩一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:56.043 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只剩一个了！打败他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:56.126 --> 00:13:58.254 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打倒那个傻瓜剑客警官！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:58.337 --> 00:14:03.467 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>向镇上的市民发誓
你不会再以这种方式欺压他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:04.051 --> 00:14:05.761 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就到此为止吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:09.181 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你可以用
任何你喜欢的理由逮捕在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:09.265 --> 00:14:10.307 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:10.391 --> 00:14:12.643 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不会做这么丢脸的事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:13.602 --> 00:14:14.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那气势</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:15.938 --> 00:14:19.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是无需二剑的示现流
萨摩藩最厉害的流派！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:20.526 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>宇治木 住手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:20.609 --> 00:14:21.944 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个人是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:22.027 --> 00:14:23.863 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:23.946 --> 00:14:26.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>示现流确实是独特的流派</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:28.826 --> 00:14:29.702 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:29.785 --> 00:14:34.665 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面对飞天御剑流时 毫无作用</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:44.675 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:47.177 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有受伤吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:47.261 --> 00:14:49.096 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太棒了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:49.179 --> 00:14:52.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你是哪里人？
-和我们一起喝一杯吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:54.435 --> 00:14:55.853 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村！</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:57.521 --> 00:14:59.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>终于找到你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:02.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我找你十年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:02.484 --> 00:15:05.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你留胡子了 山县先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:08.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>山县？该不会是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:09.033 --> 00:15:15.122 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>帝国最强军队“奇兵队”的将军</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:15.205 --> 00:15:18.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士 山县有朋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:18.834 --> 00:15:21.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-警官 请清下场
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:21.795 --> 00:15:23.505 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 快离开这里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:25.257 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太咄咄逼人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:25.341 --> 00:15:26.675 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>稍后见！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:26.759 --> 00:15:29.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我有马车在等我</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:29.887 --> 00:15:33.974 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很多战友一直在等你回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:35.184 --> 00:15:36.810 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:41.231 --> 00:15:42.524 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:43.692 --> 00:15:47.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没意向用刽子手的经验
来谋一份肥差</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:48.864 --> 00:15:50.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:50.366 --> 00:15:54.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使你杀了人 也是复辟王朝
伟大事业中令人钦佩的一部分</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:54.745 --> 00:15:57.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 有些人讨厌你是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:57.915 --> 00:15:59.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我还是会好好关照他们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:01.835 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>利用官威镇压他们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:03.212 --> 00:16:08.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正是这种想法造就了像他那样的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:08.926 --> 00:16:11.387 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们举起刀剑杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:12.137 --> 00:16:15.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了创建一个
人人可以追求幸福的世界</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.769 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是为了谋求有权有势
尽享荣华的职位</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:18.852 --> 00:16:25.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果忘了这点
我们就白白发起革命了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:31.532 --> 00:16:32.700 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是绯村！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:32.783 --> 00:16:36.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代变了！现在是明治时代！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:39.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀剑被禁 武士也没落了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:39.581 --> 00:16:42.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不像江户末期
刀剑是主流的时候了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.545 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:44.628 --> 00:16:49.133 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有政府的力量
单凭一把剑是做不到任何事情的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:51.885 --> 00:16:53.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>单凭一把剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:56.557 --> 00:17:01.770 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少在下可以保护身边的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:03.522 --> 00:17:06.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>过去到现在 在下一直没变</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:06.817 --> 00:17:10.946 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只不过由“刽子手”变为“浪客”了</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:18.287 --> 00:17:20.956 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-长官…
-我明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:25.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看大家的反应就知道是谁的错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:25.919 --> 00:17:29.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的剑不构成危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:29.506 --> 00:17:30.674 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事就这样吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:31.216 --> 00:17:32.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:32.342 --> 00:17:35.429 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这场恶作剧之前</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:35.512 --> 00:17:40.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为刽子手拔刀斋是危险人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:41.894 --> 00:17:44.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然真人还是很不一样的</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:47.566 --> 00:17:50.027 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.195 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:51.278 --> 00:17:55.866 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的带子因为在下的缘故毁了</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:57.242 --> 00:18:01.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 你用心做家务就算补偿了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:02.247 --> 00:18:04.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有 不要忘记去杂货店买东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:04.208 --> 00:18:05.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不会走吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:05.709 --> 00:18:09.338 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到家记得把要洗的衣服收起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:14.259 --> 00:18:16.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想我好像有点明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:16.804 --> 00:18:19.056 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心为什么变成浪客了</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:26.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样 他就可以继续
用剑保护大家的自由了</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:26.355 --> 00:18:28.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心听任命运安排</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:29.149 --> 00:18:31.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此 他成为了一名浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:39.785 --> 00:18:45.040 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来像个孩子
但内心已经像个大人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:45.124 --> 00:18:46.667 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:47.334 --> 00:18:48.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个小镇的市民</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:49.002 --> 00:18:51.338 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要对这些人拔剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:52.214 --> 00:18:55.008 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想找对手的话 在下在此恭候</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:57.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:05.602 --> 00:19:10.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给不了钱 你就没价值了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:16.238 --> 00:19:17.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷活心流）</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:17.364 --> 00:19:18.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:24.872 --> 00:19:25.664 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.378 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个小孩…</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:31.461 --> 00:19:33.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是小孩子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:33.505 --> 00:19:36.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是东京武士之子 明神弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:36.133 --> 00:19:39.052 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没那么堕落
不需要陌生人同情！</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:42.681 --> 00:19:47.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在更好的世界里
他将来会是一名优秀的武士呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:16.131 --> 00:20:17.090 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:17.716 --> 00:20:19.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:20.385 --> 00:20:22.095 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在是晚上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:22.179 --> 00:20:25.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个月的钱结一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:25.599 --> 00:20:27.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我没有
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:29.519 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我再也不偷东西了</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:29.603 --> 00:20:31.480 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天起
我要和你们极道黑帮一刀两断</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:31.563 --> 00:20:34.066 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你知道你在说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:48.455 --> 00:20:50.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:52.668 --> 00:20:54.628 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没听错</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:57.965 --> 00:21:01.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是厌倦了做像扒窃这样可悲的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.766 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还是那么混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:14.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候教教你谁是老大了</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:22:46.531 --> 00:22:49.743 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《活心流 重振声威》</c.simplifiedchinese>

